The color wheel is the key to playing Magic: five mana colors, five playstyles, five ways to assemble your deck. Are you inventive like Iron Man? Cunning like Black Widow? Protective like Captain America? Learn about what each color brings to the table, and the Marvel heroes and villains that embody them, as you begin your Magic origin story.

